    "value": "## Testing Values\n\n```\n<http://somewhere/RebeccaSmith/>\n    info:age \"23\"^^xsd:integer ;\n    vCard:FN \"Becky Smith\" ;\n    vCard:N [ vCard:Family \"Smith\" ;\n              vCard:Given  \"Rebecca\" ] .\n```",
